What was taken, from BAAI/bge-m3 at commit 5617a9f61b028005a4858fdac845db406aefb181:
assets/bge-m3-mha.onnx is its onnx/model.onnx with the attention of its 24 layers fused into
ONNX Runtime's MultiHeadAttention (docs/spike/local-embeddings/fuse.py), and holds the layers'
query, key and value biases. Its other weights are read from the model's own onnx/model.onnx_data,
which oboete does not include.
